WEBVTT

00:12.602 --> 00:14.604
[opening theme song playing]

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

01:42.567 --> 01:43.944
[women laughing]

01:44.027 --> 01:46.571
I've been there before, you know.
It's really good!

01:46.655 --> 01:47.989
- We should go sometime!
- Oh, really?

01:48.073 --> 01:49.491
- [woman 1] I'd love to!
- [woman 2] Great!

01:49.574 --> 01:52.452
- [woman 1] What kind of food is it?
- It's kind of a mix of a few cuisines.

01:52.536 --> 01:53.370
RECEPTION ROOM

01:53.453 --> 01:55.122
I have pictures from last time.
I'll show you!

01:55.205 --> 01:56.206
[woman 1] Yeah, let me see!

01:57.916 --> 02:00.710
Mr. Sakai, what exactly is going on here?

02:01.378 --> 02:04.005
What do you mean you won't join
the Glory Days Party?

02:04.756 --> 02:06.800
You only won the election
because of support

02:06.883 --> 02:09.511
from our Anti-Transfloration Movement.

02:10.387 --> 02:11.721
You have to understand that

02:11.805 --> 02:14.975
the Transfloration system
cannot be abolished that easily.

02:15.058 --> 02:17.477
First we'll work on
increasing oxygen supply

02:17.561 --> 02:20.147
while still utilizing
the Transfloration system.

02:23.692 --> 02:25.944
It's all about balance, Hikasa.

02:26.528 --> 02:29.239
Society isn't able to change that quickly.

02:29.739 --> 02:30.574
[claps]

02:30.657 --> 02:31.658
[Sakai grunts]

02:32.200 --> 02:33.285
What was that for?

02:33.869 --> 02:36.496
[Hikasa] In order to form
a new political party,

02:36.580 --> 02:39.416
five Diet members must serve
as its core members.

02:39.583 --> 02:40.417
[claps]

02:40.500 --> 02:42.627
You are one of those five.

02:43.170 --> 02:44.212
[Sakai] Hmm.

02:44.296 --> 02:47.048
I'm not just some sideshow
for attracting customers, you know.

02:47.132 --> 02:48.300
- [claps]
- [Sakai grunts]

02:48.383 --> 02:49.926
Why do you keep doing that, huh?

02:50.010 --> 02:50.927
You need to stop!

02:51.553 --> 02:53.972
You really want to know
what this sound is?

02:55.640 --> 02:57.100
[Sakai exclaims fearfully]

03:00.061 --> 03:02.105
I was wondering something.

03:02.188 --> 03:04.733
How many people are left in this house?

03:08.236 --> 03:09.863
[crowd clamoring]

03:10.488 --> 03:14.910
The much-anticipated policy speech
by the Glory Days Party is about to begin.

03:20.498 --> 03:22.500
[announcer]
<i>Please welcome the Secretary General</i>

03:22.584 --> 03:24.920
<i>of the Glory Days Party, Ken Hikasa.</i>

03:25.003 --> 03:26.755
[crowd cheering]

03:34.512 --> 03:35.722
[cheering fades]

03:37.015 --> 03:38.600
Good morning and thank you for coming.

03:38.683 --> 03:40.268
My name is Ken Hikasa.

03:42.938 --> 03:45.523
This may come as a surprise to you,
but I am a liar.

03:45.607 --> 03:46.566
[crowd murmuring]

03:46.650 --> 03:47.859
[man] What does he mean?

03:48.318 --> 03:50.362
The truth is, I was born into a family

03:50.445 --> 03:52.530
that didn't have a lot of money
when I was growing up.

03:52.614 --> 03:53.531
We were not wealthy.

03:54.282 --> 03:57.285
We could never afford
enough food or school supplies,

03:57.369 --> 04:00.789
But there was one thing
that our family did have.

04:00.872 --> 04:03.041
We were strongly bound together by love.

04:04.042 --> 04:06.586
However, as the Oxygen Tax
continued to rise,

04:06.670 --> 04:10.715
my family was left with even less money
to live on than we had before.

04:12.050 --> 04:14.219
It reached a point where I made a wish

04:14.302 --> 04:17.764
that my grandmother
would undergo Transfloration.

04:17.847 --> 04:19.307
And my wish came true.

04:20.141 --> 04:23.520
Right up until my grandmother's
Transfloration was complete,

04:23.603 --> 04:26.314
she never stopped expressing
her love for me.

04:27.023 --> 04:28.149
Whenever she did,

04:28.233 --> 04:31.236
I wanted to return her words of love,
but I couldn't.

04:31.903 --> 04:35.490
After having once wished for her death
for my own benefit,

04:35.573 --> 04:38.410
how could I possibly tell her
that I loved her?

04:38.952 --> 04:41.413
I'll spend the rest of my life
regretting that.

04:42.414 --> 04:45.792
A society where people wish
for the death of their own family members

04:45.875 --> 04:47.627
can't possibly be healthy!

04:47.711 --> 04:50.797
We have to make a change once and for all!

04:51.548 --> 04:52.841
[crowd exclaiming]

04:55.010 --> 04:56.970
What is that thing? A light?

04:57.554 --> 04:59.848
We have a sun, right here!

05:00.432 --> 05:03.727
It's the sun of universal love
that shines equally on us all!

05:03.810 --> 05:05.937
[crowd cheering]

05:07.063 --> 05:09.107
We don't have a never-ending night here.

05:09.941 --> 05:12.402
Have a wonderful morning, everyone.

05:12.485 --> 05:16.156
And please continue your support
for the Glory Days Party!

05:19.576 --> 05:21.244
[camera shutters clicking]

05:21.328 --> 05:22.871
[reporter 1] Mr. Hikasa, look this way.

05:22.954 --> 05:25.206
Mr. Hikasa, I'm from <i>Koyomi</i> newspaper.

05:25.290 --> 05:26.624
Can you answer some questions?

05:26.708 --> 05:29.961
[reporter 2] Regarding policy changes,
do you have any more comments?

05:30.045 --> 05:33.631
HIKASA + KUDAI

05:34.341 --> 05:36.801
[rock music playing]

05:43.892 --> 05:44.893
Still nothing?

05:44.976 --> 05:46.853
Even after all of our investigating,

05:46.936 --> 05:49.481
I'm surprised that
Dr. Kudai's name hasn't come up.

05:50.899 --> 05:53.651
Then I guess we'll just
have to make the first move.

05:58.281 --> 06:01.242
I'll use Kudai's name
to lure Hikasa to us instead.

06:01.326 --> 06:03.328
A declaration of war, huh?

06:03.411 --> 06:04.788
When Hikasa sees this,

06:04.871 --> 06:06.998
I know for sure he'll want
to do something about it.

06:07.082 --> 06:09.959
And I have an idea of what to do
if he takes the bait.

06:10.668 --> 06:12.003
Wow, I'm impressed.

06:12.087 --> 06:13.880
This plan could really work.

06:14.506 --> 06:16.841
But, this declaration of war…

06:16.925 --> 06:18.843
why do you have to be the one to do it?

06:19.594 --> 06:20.762
That would mean you'd…

06:21.346 --> 06:22.847
You'd be targeted again.

06:25.016 --> 06:26.226
You could be killed.

06:27.769 --> 06:28.812
[Yomiko] Toshiro.

06:29.437 --> 06:30.939
[Toshiro grunting]

06:31.022 --> 06:31.898
[groaning]

06:31.981 --> 06:36.111
I swear that I am going to protect you
and Transflora Medical.

06:36.194 --> 06:37.987
I'll kill anyone I need to, got it?

06:39.614 --> 06:41.574
- [Saeko laughing]
- No more being a crybaby.

06:41.658 --> 06:43.118
I'm doing it.

06:43.660 --> 06:44.869
[Toshiro] 'Kay.

06:50.333 --> 06:52.293
She was on the press list at reception.

06:54.587 --> 06:55.755
NAME: AI AKIYAMA
AFFILIATION: MEETUP

06:55.839 --> 06:59.175
[Hikasa] Before you kill her, find out
what she was trying to extort from me.

07:05.473 --> 07:07.559
I'll provide my name, organization,

07:07.642 --> 07:09.853
and address on the press list
for the event.

07:09.936 --> 07:11.729
It'll be a fake name, obviously.

07:11.813 --> 07:15.191
I'll also say I work for some made-up
subcontractor for a magazine.

07:15.275 --> 07:18.653
I'm even going to rent an office
in a multi-tenant building.

07:18.736 --> 07:20.113
You think they'll go there?

07:20.697 --> 07:22.657
Yes, and we'll capture
one of the bodyguards.

07:23.241 --> 07:25.994
Toshiro will help us
interrogate the man with his power.

07:26.077 --> 07:28.663
After that, we'll threaten him
into spying for us.

07:28.746 --> 07:31.624
But, we'll only go through with this
if there are one or two bodyguards.

07:31.708 --> 07:33.418
If there are more, we'll call it off.

07:36.504 --> 07:37.630
[car stops]

07:37.714 --> 07:38.673
[car doors open, shut]

07:41.509 --> 07:43.136
[Akira] <i>Kanaeno, they're here.</i>

07:43.678 --> 07:44.888
<i>There's two.</i>

07:44.971 --> 07:46.764
[in sing-song voice] All right, copy that.

07:47.765 --> 07:49.184
[elevator dings]

08:05.825 --> 08:07.160
[elevator dinging]

08:10.330 --> 08:11.873
- [glass shattering]
- [grunting]

08:11.956 --> 08:13.500
[grunting, groaning]

08:18.254 --> 08:20.006
- [grunting]
- [electricity crackling]

08:20.423 --> 08:21.508
Dammit!

08:21.591 --> 08:23.927
[straining]

08:25.261 --> 08:27.055
[panting]

08:27.138 --> 08:28.932
[choking]

08:29.015 --> 08:30.308
Nighty-night.

08:30.892 --> 08:32.393
[panting]

08:41.319 --> 08:42.779
[elevator dings]

08:45.782 --> 08:47.116
[gasps]

08:48.493 --> 08:50.495
- [Saeko grunts]
- [man cries out]

08:50.578 --> 08:52.497
[high-pitched ringing]

09:03.633 --> 09:05.093
[groaning softly]

09:08.513 --> 09:09.722
[gasps softly]

09:09.806 --> 09:14.978
A SEED WAS PLANTED IN YOUR BODY

09:15.061 --> 09:16.229
[gasps softly]

09:17.689 --> 09:20.525
WE HAVE SECRETLY DEVELOPED
A GROWTH INHIBITOR

09:20.608 --> 09:23.486
THAT DELAYS THE GROWTH OF "SEEDS"

09:25.572 --> 09:28.032
ANSWER MY QUESTIONS HONESTLY

09:28.116 --> 09:30.827
NOD IF IT'S A YES
SHAKE YOUR HEAD IF IT'S A NO

09:31.327 --> 09:35.498
WE'LL ADMINISTER THE GROWTH INHIBITOR
IF YOU ANSWER

09:35.999 --> 09:37.166
[gasps]

09:40.336 --> 09:41.254
GROWTH INHIBITOR

09:41.921 --> 09:44.507
Is there really such a thing
as a growth inhibitor?

09:44.591 --> 09:45.758
No, there's not.

09:45.842 --> 09:47.510
And there won't be a Seed.

09:47.844 --> 09:50.638
We'll make an incision just large enough
for him to feel a lump.

09:52.015 --> 09:54.851
Saying that he'll undergo Transfloration,

09:54.934 --> 09:57.729
that should be enough
to break a member of the Movement.

09:58.146 --> 09:59.147
Oh…

09:59.230 --> 10:00.857
[ominous music playing]

10:02.108 --> 10:04.902
HAVE YOU EVER MET DR. KUDAI?

10:07.238 --> 10:08.781
[breathing shakily]

10:15.038 --> 10:16.539
[Toshiro] Panic.

10:16.623 --> 10:17.957
Confusion.

10:18.041 --> 10:19.083
Hostility.

10:19.584 --> 10:20.752
A sense of duty.

10:21.461 --> 10:22.462
Denial.

10:23.588 --> 10:24.714
He's lying.

10:24.797 --> 10:26.215
He's met him before.

10:26.299 --> 10:27.467
[gasps]

10:31.137 --> 10:33.473
DID YOU MEET HIM HERE?

10:35.850 --> 10:36.976
[Toshiro] He's not lying.

10:37.560 --> 10:39.228
AROUND HERE?

10:40.813 --> 10:42.231
HERE?

10:44.317 --> 10:45.652
WHERE?

10:45.902 --> 10:47.737
You've been asking him
way too many questions.

10:47.820 --> 10:48.780
IN ANOTHER
METROPOLITAN AREA?

10:48.863 --> 10:50.948
If he gets used to lying,
I won't be able to read him.

10:53.201 --> 10:58.998
THERE ARE 10 OR MORE INTELLIGENCE AGENTS
UNDER KEN HIKASA'S COMMAND

11:01.542 --> 11:02.502
[Toshiro] <i>He's lying.</i>

11:02.585 --> 11:03.920
<i>There are more agents.</i>

11:04.003 --> 11:05.421
[alarm beeping]

11:06.089 --> 11:07.298
<i>The second group's here.</i>

11:07.382 --> 11:09.008
[Yomiko]
<i>They're way earlier than expected.</i>

11:09.676 --> 11:11.386
<i>We were supposed to be done already.</i>

11:14.472 --> 11:17.141
WE CAN'T HAND OVER
THE GROWTH INHIBITOR YET

11:17.225 --> 11:21.396
BRING USEFUL INFORMATION
ABOUT THE DOCTOR IN THREE DAYS…

11:26.567 --> 11:27.902
[Yomiko] What are you doing? Let's go!

11:30.363 --> 11:34.033
Tell me one thing. Is Ivy still alive?

11:34.117 --> 11:36.160
[alarm continues beeping]

11:46.379 --> 11:50.800
[Spiriflora chittering, buzzing]

12:05.648 --> 12:06.983
[alarm stops]

12:08.985 --> 12:11.154
So what should we do, Nishi?

12:11.237 --> 12:14.949
Do you wanna just charge into
the building now and kill all of them?

12:15.032 --> 12:16.325
That won't work.

12:16.409 --> 12:18.911
We have no idea what kind of traps
they've set in there for us.

12:18.995 --> 12:21.330
Here's what I'm thinking, Mr. Harubara.

12:21.414 --> 12:24.417
move from the building next door
to the roof of the target building.

12:24.500 --> 12:27.128
That way, we'll sandwich them
from above and below.

12:29.547 --> 12:31.048
[Yomiko panting]

12:31.132 --> 12:32.758
Kanaeno's way ahead of us.

12:43.895 --> 12:45.271
[grunting]

12:47.523 --> 12:49.400
[panting, grunting]

12:53.404 --> 12:54.822
[grunting]

12:55.907 --> 12:57.283
- [bullet whizzes]
- [grunts]

12:58.201 --> 12:59.368
[Saeko] A gunshot?

13:00.077 --> 13:01.496
[Toshiro grunts]

13:02.955 --> 13:03.956
They're fast.

13:06.042 --> 13:08.336
[Harubara] <i>How'd they get away?</i>
<i>I got here so quickly.</i>

13:08.419 --> 13:10.963
- [silenced gunshots]
- [Toshiro grunting]

13:12.215 --> 13:13.090
[Saeko grunts]

13:14.425 --> 13:16.260
[Harubara grunting]

13:18.721 --> 13:20.973
[both grunting]

13:32.109 --> 13:33.444
You're pretty good.

13:34.070 --> 13:34.904
Huh?

13:36.948 --> 13:40.326
I know, so it's too bad
you can't shoot me now.

13:42.411 --> 13:44.080
Bye-bye.

13:51.254 --> 13:52.964
- [Toshiro] Drive!
- What happened?

13:53.047 --> 13:55.508
Why are you bleeding so much?
Are you guys okay?

13:55.591 --> 13:56.759
Just get outta here!

13:57.176 --> 13:58.010
[Saeko] Drive!

13:58.094 --> 13:59.220
[tires screeching]

14:04.934 --> 14:06.477
[engine accelerating]

14:08.896 --> 14:10.189
That was Akira.

14:11.816 --> 14:12.733
[Harubara grunting]

14:13.943 --> 14:15.111
It's no use.

14:15.194 --> 14:16.737
I can't cut it or take it off.

14:16.821 --> 14:21.033
Those people,
they knew about Dr. Kudai and Ivy.

14:21.117 --> 14:24.453
And they also asked about
the number of intelligence personnel

14:24.537 --> 14:26.414
and Dr. Kudai's exact location.

14:26.497 --> 14:28.249
Of course, I didn't tell them anything.

14:29.208 --> 14:32.003
Hold on, do you still have
your party badge with you?

14:33.045 --> 14:34.630
If it's not on the inside of my collar,

14:35.172 --> 14:36.257
it was stolen.

14:37.300 --> 14:38.885
Then we have nothing to worry about.

14:39.385 --> 14:42.555
No one will be able to connect your body
to the Glory Days Party.

14:42.638 --> 14:43.639
- Huh?
- [gunshot]

14:47.101 --> 14:48.394
You were stuck there,

14:48.477 --> 14:50.271
and if we can't move you,
then you have to die.

14:51.147 --> 14:52.732
Nishi, what should we do?

14:52.815 --> 14:55.526
He'll be easier to carry out
if we cut him into four pieces.

14:55.985 --> 14:58.863
It'll take two to three hours
if we do it with that knife.

14:59.822 --> 15:02.116
If only that monster were here
to cut him up for us,

15:02.199 --> 15:04.035
then the whole thing
would be done in no time.

15:04.827 --> 15:06.370
Let's go back, okay?

15:06.454 --> 15:08.205
Now we know who the enemy is.

15:09.707 --> 15:12.293
[protestors chanting]
Down with Transfloration!

15:13.210 --> 15:15.504
Down with Transfloration!

15:16.130 --> 15:18.633
Down with Transfloration!

15:19.383 --> 15:22.011
- Down with Transfloration!
- [man] Don't let 'em get away with this!

15:22.094 --> 15:24.680
My son was one of the people
killed by that monster!

15:26.182 --> 15:28.684
- Down with Transfloration!
- [sighs]

15:28.768 --> 15:31.437
[pop music plays on radio]

15:31.520 --> 15:34.982
I was told you're borrowing
Kunibe's mercenary unit to help.

15:35.066 --> 15:37.401
That's right and now that
we know Ivy's still alive,

15:37.485 --> 15:39.695
none of us can afford to be
defenseless anymore.

15:40.821 --> 15:42.949
The protests are getting
more violent, too.

15:43.032 --> 15:45.534
So, I figured we needed
a strong ally on our side

15:45.618 --> 15:48.329
if we wanted to get into contact
with Dr. Kudai.

15:48.412 --> 15:51.916
To be honest, I'm a bit surprised
you were able to convince Kunibe.

15:51.999 --> 15:55.586
"A Glory Days Party member was
overcome by his conscience

15:55.670 --> 15:58.839
and he revealed to us
exactly how Ivy was created.

15:58.923 --> 16:02.259
Afterwards, he was murdered
for giving us that information."

16:02.343 --> 16:03.844
That was the story I told Kunibe.

16:04.804 --> 16:06.514
When I showed him
the party member's corpse

16:06.597 --> 16:10.309
and the file on Ivy, as evidence,
he believed me.

16:10.393 --> 16:12.979
I mean, neither of those things
would have ended up in our hands

16:13.062 --> 16:15.356
without some kind of leak
on the inside, right?

16:15.439 --> 16:17.483
So, basically, you presented the evidence

16:17.566 --> 16:20.820
that Toshiro and the others
brought back after the fact.

16:20.903 --> 16:24.115
You know, he was very happy
to hear that Ivy was still alive.

16:24.907 --> 16:27.326
He said he'd help us
in any way that he could.

16:28.077 --> 16:30.496
Good thing
the Anti-Transfloration Movement did that,

16:30.579 --> 16:32.081
killed one of their own.

16:32.164 --> 16:35.167
It's the reason our story
was actually convincing, I think.

16:35.251 --> 16:37.753
You said you wanted
to turn that man into a spy for us.

16:38.838 --> 16:40.631
That was never your plan.

16:40.715 --> 16:43.050
This all worked out
how you wanted, didn't it?

16:43.134 --> 16:44.885
You knew that he would be killed
in the end.

16:47.179 --> 16:49.306
Hang on, were you just
reading my emotions?

16:49.390 --> 16:50.808
No, I wasn't.

16:50.891 --> 16:52.643
I don't wanna do that to you, Yomiko.

16:53.185 --> 16:56.105
The reason he died
is because those people were cruel.

16:58.190 --> 17:03.154
So, since Kunibe is working with us now,
what'll happen to Ivy?

17:03.237 --> 17:04.864
- [Yomiko] We'll hand him over.
- [gasps]

17:04.947 --> 17:07.033
As payment for lending us
his mercenary unit.

17:07.658 --> 17:09.702
He'll be experimented on until he dies.

17:10.619 --> 17:12.455
Why are you so shocked?

17:13.247 --> 17:14.665
Are you feeling sorry for him?

17:14.749 --> 17:17.251
You do realize that
he almost killed me, right?

17:17.334 --> 17:20.629
He almost killed Akira,
Kanaeno, and you, as well.

17:20.713 --> 17:24.633
I mean, dozens of citizens
have already been killed by him.

17:27.303 --> 17:31.015
The crimes he's committed far outweigh
any sympathy that he might deserve.

17:31.640 --> 17:32.767
[breathing shakily]

17:34.101 --> 17:35.311
I'm leaving.

17:41.776 --> 17:43.235
[brakes squealing]

17:43.319 --> 17:45.237
Welcome back home, sir.

17:46.822 --> 17:48.657
A letter arrived for you.

17:49.533 --> 17:50.451
Hmm?

17:51.285 --> 17:53.037
HOUSE OF LOVE
SASAKI ORPHANAGE

17:53.120 --> 17:57.208
THANK YOU FOR EVERYTHING, SIR.

18:07.301 --> 18:09.095
[door creaking]

18:09.178 --> 18:10.221
Hmm?

18:15.893 --> 18:17.812
[Nishi] The enemy is Transflora Medical.

18:19.313 --> 18:22.066
[Hikasa]
What do you think it is they wanna know?

18:22.149 --> 18:25.528
From what I gathered, they wanna know
about Dr. Kudai and Ivy.

18:25.611 --> 18:27.947
It seemed like they were trying
to find out where they are.

18:29.073 --> 18:32.118
Well, we can't let those people
meet either of them.

18:32.201 --> 18:33.828
So where is Ivy now?

18:33.911 --> 18:36.622
He's with Dr. Kudai,
recovering from before.

18:37.414 --> 18:40.960
But the time will come for him
to work for the sake of the world.

18:41.585 --> 18:43.963
We have to be grateful
for his noble sacrifice.

18:45.256 --> 18:48.384
[Nishi] I wonder how they knew about
your relationship with the doctor.

18:48.467 --> 18:49.760
I have no clue.

18:49.844 --> 18:52.263
I would like to go meet
with Dr. Kudai in person

18:52.346 --> 18:53.722
and ask him about all of this,

18:53.806 --> 18:55.975
but it looks like somebody
is watching me now.

18:56.058 --> 18:57.518
[Nishi] Seriously?

18:57.601 --> 18:59.478
Is that why we're meeting here?

18:59.562 --> 19:00.688
[Hikasa] It is.

19:00.771 --> 19:04.942
The doorstop in my study was
in a different position from when I left.

19:05.776 --> 19:08.904
[man] <i>They're too far away</i>
<i>for me to understand a thing.</i>

19:09.530 --> 19:13.450
If I went to see him right now,
they'd find out where he is.

19:13.534 --> 19:15.202
If you're unable to make a move,

19:15.286 --> 19:16.954
how about if we go
and meet with him for you?

19:18.455 --> 19:20.958
[Hikasa] You guys could never do it alone.

19:21.041 --> 19:23.085
In order to meet with the doctor…

19:23.169 --> 19:25.963
we've agreed to exchange
the time and specific coordinates

19:26.046 --> 19:27.339
over a secure line,

19:27.423 --> 19:29.675
and then I have to be the one to go there.

19:30.634 --> 19:34.930
If Dr. Kudai does have some kind
of connection to Transflora Medical,

19:35.014 --> 19:37.099
and we aren't able
to personally question him about it,

19:37.183 --> 19:40.019
then there's only one thing
we need to investigate.

19:40.102 --> 19:42.104
Transflora Medical itself.

19:43.397 --> 19:44.565
That's right.

19:45.941 --> 19:47.026
[Nishi] Just one more thing.

19:48.110 --> 19:50.029
Can you tell me anything about him?

19:50.112 --> 19:53.741
About the doctor, before he disappeared
that isn't public knowledge?

19:54.533 --> 19:57.411
That would make it a whole lot easier
for me to infiltrate them.

19:57.494 --> 20:01.290
I'm well aware that all of the information
about Dr. Kudai is classified,

20:01.373 --> 20:03.042
but any little bit could help.

20:06.962 --> 20:10.174
Dr. Kudai spent time
working somewhere in Antarctica.

20:10.883 --> 20:12.593
[protestors clamoring]

20:12.676 --> 20:14.803
[man 1] You can't be serious.
What you're is illegal!

20:14.887 --> 20:16.805
[man 2] Down with
the Transfloration system!

20:16.889 --> 20:20.059
[man 1] You created a monster
that killed innocent people!

20:20.142 --> 20:22.061
[straining]

20:23.646 --> 20:25.481
[man 3] This corporation is evil!

20:25.564 --> 20:27.066
[man 1] You bastards!

20:27.149 --> 20:29.568
KAORI & TOSHIRO KAMIYA

20:41.413 --> 20:43.123
[Toshiro] <i>Born in Paupertown.</i>

20:45.626 --> 20:49.338
<i>Making a living while constantly</i>
<i>being exposed to the cold wind.</i>

20:51.131 --> 20:53.133
<i>Having your only family stolen from you.</i>

20:54.426 --> 20:55.386
SHIIKA

20:55.469 --> 20:58.180
<i>And then killed,</i>
<i>just to be turned into furniture.</i>

21:00.975 --> 21:02.059
<i>He finally…</i>

21:03.560 --> 21:05.771
<i>He finally got out of Paupertown.</i>

21:08.607 --> 21:11.110
<i>If he's caught by Transflora Medical,</i>

21:11.193 --> 21:14.029
<i>he'll be experimented on</i>
<i>for the rest of his life.</i>

21:14.113 --> 21:17.950
<i>But if we do nothing,</i>
<i>Ivy will murder again.</i>

21:19.326 --> 21:21.620
[voice shaking] All of this is too cruel.

21:22.538 --> 21:26.625
The crimes he's committed far outweigh
any sympathy that he might deserve.

21:26.709 --> 21:28.585
[sniffles] <i>I know.</i>

21:29.878 --> 21:32.089
<i>I know that he has to be punished.</i>

21:33.799 --> 21:34.883
<i>I know.</i>

21:34.967 --> 21:36.885
[sniffling] <i>I know that.</i>

21:36.969 --> 21:39.013
[sobbing] <i>I know.</i>

21:42.057 --> 21:42.933
Ivy.

21:44.977 --> 21:48.022
[Ivy] <i>This is the first time</i>
<i>that I could tell someone.</i>

22:08.208 --> 22:09.293
[Toshiro] <i>I…</i>

22:11.045 --> 22:12.588
<i>I have to do it alone.</i>

22:14.673 --> 22:15.841
<i>I have to…</i>

22:17.051 --> 22:18.510
<i>I have to kill him.</i>

22:22.514 --> 22:24.516
[closing theme music playing]
